      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a good start, but it's a bit too brief for a Nature-level review. it needs more depth regarding the potential for impurities during the annealing phase and how that specifically correlates to the EPR noise.\n\ncan you expand this into a more detailed, formal review? I want it to feel much more comprehensive and multi-faceted. Again, please don't just pad it out with fluff or artificial subheadings to inflate that \"structural thoroughness\" score—I need actual technical depth, not just a longer list of headers. Just make it a much more robust and detailed critique.",
